`tests/test_img_lightbox_gestures_behavior.py` has six runtime-style rows, but they extract and `eval` eight nested helpers from `_mountImgLightboxZoom` into a fabricated state/viewport/image. They never mount the complete production lightbox or invoke `_openImgLightboxWithNav`.

