### Fix specification

Add a production-composed browser/JS target that mounts the real lightbox and drives the listeners it registers. It must verify:

1. extreme-pan clamping and undersized-axis centering through the actual pointer path;
2. wheel and two-touch pinch anchoring through the real event handlers;
