For a normal option with value `@custom:backup:model-a:free`, no `data-model`, and option provider `custom:backup`, `explicitProvider` becomes `custom:backup:model-a`. The result is therefore `{model: "free", model_provider: "custom:backup"}` rather than model `model-a:free`.

