On current master, `api/routes.py:20609-20615` reads `MEMORY.md`, `USER.md`, and `SOUL.md` as distinct files. The proposed GET path preserves that shape, so a user can still see SOUL content but cannot save it. This is a concrete behavior mismatch, not just naming.

