`_collectSettingsIndex(false)` skips only the three lazy sections, so Conversation, Appearance, Preferences, System, and Help can produce useful first-keystroke results without waiting on network-backed panes. Once loading finishes, the identity check on `_settingsIndexPromise` prevents an old panel-session build from repopulating a newly reset session.

